  "question_stem": "Eric has three coins. One of the coins is fair. The other two coins are each biased so that the probability of obtaining a head on any throw is $\\frac{1}{4}$, independently of all other throws. Eric throws all three coins at the same time.\n\nEvents $A$ and $B$ are defined as follows.\n\n$A$: all three coins show the same result\n\n$B$: at least one of the biased coins shows a head",
  "context_texts": [
    "$P(B)=\\frac7{16}$."
  ],
